Dialogue: 2,0:21:58.17,0:22:04.22,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}在另一侧 今天仍有人
Dialogue: 2,0:22:04.35,0:22:10.19,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}日渐颓败 却仍然站立
Dialogue: 2,0:22:10.35,0:22:16.07,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}刺痛胸口的这份寂寞
Dialogue: 2,0:22:16.23,0:22:21.95,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}点或是线 断断续续
Dialogue: 2,0:22:21.95,0:22:24.99,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}面具碎裂
Dialogue: 2,0:22:24.99,0:22:27.95,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}那无法回避的一切
Dialogue: 2,0:22:27.95,0:22:31.00,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}不得不活下去
Dialogue: 2,0:22:31.00,0:22:35.67,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}明天已经在等待
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.67,0:22:41.26,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}无边无际 却又如此短暂
Dialogue: 2,0:22:41.26,0:22:47.43,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}就当作心这种东西 根本不存在吧
Dialogue: 2,0:22:47.68,0:22:50.68,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}耀眼得难以直视
Dialogue: 2,0:22:50.68,0:22:54.73,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}柔软的手心
Dialogue: 2,0:22:54.73,0:23:03.03,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}那一天 我回握了那只手
Comment: 0,0:22:17.15,0:22:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,
